{"company":{"company_name":"Strive, Inc. - Class A Common Stock","company_summary":{},"financials":{},"market_observations":[{"as_of":"2026-10-15T20:50:31.789319+00:00","daily_return_pct":3.8905775075987803,"horizon":"3 Month","horizon_return_pct":107.7390599675851,"price_pattern":"Up / cooling","reference_price":25.635,"reference_price_basis":"last daily close observed by the market snapshot","screen_reason":"Momentum rotation"}],"research_horizons":["3 Month"],"ticker":"ASST"},"market_context":{"economy":{},"market":{"confidence":"medium","headline":"Market Explorer 1-month feed: cooling momentum leaders IOVA and KOD, single-day bounces in OPEN, QNT, BROS and BLDR, and a spin-off-adjusted CTVA","items_to_watch":["Check whether the data provider restates the CTVA price history after the 1 October 2026 Vylor spin-off, so the 1-month, 3-month and RoC values use a like-for-like base.","Check whether the empty daily-movers and momentum-profile tables are a pipeline fault, because the 80-row opportunity feed contains several one-day moves above 5%.","Find the catalyst behind IOVA's +47.2% 1-month and KOD's +167.7% 1-month gains, and test whether the negative RoC is profit-taking or a change in the underlying business.","Test whether RXO's +185.6 RoC and 0.99 trend-fit gap follow freight-brokerage news or a one-off event, given the +0.6% 3-month return.","Check whether OPEN's +16.0% day has a fundamental driver while the 1-month return stays at -9.9%, and whether QNT's 11.0% day marks a change after its June 2026 listing."],"summary":"The 1-month Market Explorer feed supports two setups among its focus names. Momentum leaders are cooling. IOVA is +47.2% over one month and +192.7% over three months, with a momentum rate of change (RoC, the speed of the recent move) of -17.2. KOD is +167.7% and +115.9% over the same windows, with RoC -1.6. A positive 1-month return with a negative RoC means the earlier gain is slowing, not reversing. IOVA's opportunity score of 67.4 is the